{
 "id": "create:mechanical_arm/setup",
 "schematic": "mechanical_arm/setup",
 "schematicNamespace": "create",
 "title": "Setting up Mechanical Arms",
 "texts": {
  "text_1": "Mechanical Arms have to be assigned their in- and outputs before they are placed",
  "text_2": "Right-Click inventories while holding the Arm to assign them as Targets",
  "text_3": "Right-Click again to toggle between Input (Blue) and Output (Yellow)",
  "text_4": "Left-Click components to remove their Selection",
  "text_5": "Once placed, the Mechanical Arm will target the blocks selected previously",
  "text_6": "They can have any amount of in- and outputs within their range",
  "text_7": "However, not every type of Inventory can be interacted with directly",
  "text_8": "Funnels and Depots can help to Bridge that gap"
 },
